@startuml osm_world_renderer_sequence
!theme plain

title OSM World Renderer Sequence Diagram

actor User
participant "testclient.py" as TestClient
participant "OsmRenderer" as Renderer
participant "MapRasterizer" as Rasterizer  
participant "MapDrawer" as Drawer
participant "CARLA Client" as CarlaClient
participant "CARLA Server" as CarlaServer
participant "OpenDriveGenerator" as ODGenerator

== OSM Data Processing ==

User -> TestClient: Run test client
activate TestClient

TestClient -> Renderer: Initialize OSM Renderer
activate Renderer

Renderer -> Rasterizer: Create MapRasterizer
activate Rasterizer

Renderer -> Drawer: Create MapDrawer  
activate Drawer

TestClient -> Renderer: Load OSM file
Renderer -> Renderer: Parse OSM XML data
note right: Extract roads, buildings,\nlandmarks from OSM

Renderer -> Rasterizer: Rasterize map geometry
Rasterizer -> Rasterizer: Convert OSM coordinates\nto world coordinates
Rasterizer -> Rasterizer: Generate road mesh data
Rasterizer --> Renderer: Return rasterized data

== Map Visualization ==

Renderer -> Drawer: Render map visualization
Drawer -> Drawer: Draw roads and intersections
Drawer -> Drawer: Draw buildings and landmarks
Drawer -> Drawer: Apply textures and materials
Drawer --> Renderer: Return rendered image

Renderer --> TestClient: Return visualization result
TestClient --> User: Display rendered map

== CARLA Integration ==

TestClient -> CarlaClient: Connect to CARLA
activate CarlaClient

CarlaClient -> CarlaServer: Request world generation
activate CarlaServer

CarlaServer -> ODGenerator: Generate OpenDrive from OSM
activate ODGenerator
note right: Uses OSM2ODR conversion\nfrom carla/PythonAPI/carla/src/OSM2ODR.cpp

ODGenerator -> ODGenerator: Convert OSM to OpenDrive format
ODGenerator -> ODGenerator: Generate road geometry
ODGenerator -> ODGenerator: Create lane markings
ODGenerator -> ODGenerator: Generate traffic signs

ODGenerator --> CarlaServer: Return OpenDrive data
deactivate ODGenerator

CarlaServer -> CarlaServer: Create 3D world mesh
CarlaServer -> CarlaServer: Spawn traffic lights
CarlaServer -> CarlaServer: Generate navigation mesh

CarlaServer --> CarlaClient: World ready
deactivate CarlaServer

CarlaClient -> CarlaClient: Set no_rendering_mode
note right: For performance testing\nwithout visual rendering

CarlaClient --> TestClient: Connection established
deactivate CarlaClient

== Cleanup ==

TestClient -> Renderer: Cleanup resources
Renderer -> Drawer: Destroy drawer
deactivate Drawer
Renderer -> Rasterizer: Destroy rasterizer  
deactivate Rasterizer
deactivate Renderer

TestClient -> CarlaClient: Disconnect
deactivate TestClient

@enduml